// Render static scenery with a depth buffer. Canvas 2D uses the same meshes on devices without WebGL.
// The aircraft occupies one opaque draw call plus its decals. The moving gear uses one reusable buffer.
// WebGL 2 requires GLSL ES 3.00. Keep the older GLSL source as a WebGL 1
// fallback so older Chromebooks still run the same self-contained simulator.
